# Credyx marketing prompt rules

Use for Instagram captions, ChatGPT/image prompts, and creative review.
Also check `docs/marketing/CREATIVE_INVENTORY.md` before proposing a new post — do not duplicate existing creatives.

## What Credyx is

- **A/R + back-office for trucking carriers** — not factoring, not cash advances.
- Carriers submit docs; Credyx verifies, invoices brokers, follows up, tracks to **paid on time**.
- Value: visibility, less chasing, back office without hiring a full A/R team.

## Real workflow (use ONLY this)

Credyx does **not** confirm load delivery or capture POD in the field.

| Step | Label | What Credyx does |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 01 | Docs received | Carrier submits paperwork / invoice packet to Credyx |
| 02 | Paperwork verified | We verify documents so nothing gets missed |
| 03 | Invoice submitted | We submit invoice (PPW) to the broker and track acceptance |
| 04 | Broker follow-up | We follow up, resolve holds/disputes, keep carrier informed |
| 05 | Payment received | We confirm payment when it arrives — **on time** |

### Invoice progress stepper (UI on creatives)

Never use: Delivered → Verified → Submitted → Paid.

**Correct order:**

1. **Submitted** — invoice/packet submitted to Credyx  
2. **Verified** — paperwork verified, good to go  
3. **Invoiced** — PPW sent to broker  
4. **Paid** — invoice paid  

## Mission & preferred lines

- Mission: *Empowering truckers. Simplifying payments. Driving success.*
- Product: *Your back office, in one portal.*
- OK: *Focus on the road. We’ll handle the rest.* · *Paid on time.* · *We keep you updated.*

## Banned

- get paid faster / paid faster / faster payments (cash promise)
- instant cash, same-day pay, advance, factoring, buy your invoices
- “We confirm delivery / capture POD” / Load Delivered as a Credyx step
- Glossy hyperreal AI truck heroes / neon truck trails (clean muted truck OK — see image-generator rule)

```
❌ “DM us · Get paid faster”
✅ “DM us · Paid on time”
✅ “DM us · See your A/R clearly”
```

## Visual rules (anti–“AI scream”)

For **generated Instagram images**, follow `.cursor/rules/credyx-image-generator.mdc` (logo + truck + clean UI + hand underline every time).

General:
- Dark navy + `#1684FE` + white; one clear message; mobile-readable
- Truck: clean/realistic, **secondary** behind curved blue divider — never glossy AI hyperreal
- No giant glowing arrows, neon haze, plastic “corporate AI” look
- Product UI cards preferred on the text side when showing features/process

## Prompt checklist

1. Brand: Credyx A/R Solutions + **logo on image**  
2. Image formula: logo · truck · clean UI · hand underline (see image-generator rule)  
3. Correct workflow / stepper if process UI is shown  
4. One pillar only (pain / proof / process / offer)  
5. Not factoring; on-time language only  
6. Approved CTA: Credyx · Paid on time  
7. UI mocks: demo data; blur real names/emails; status colors when count > 0  
8. Check inventory — don’t clone an existing post  
9. Website copy: see `docs/marketing/WAITLIST_MARKETING_SITE.md` when building public pages

## Content pillars

| Pillar | Example |
| --- | --- |
| Pain | Still chasing invoices / missing docs / holds |
| Proof | Real dashboard or mobile invoice status |
| Process | Docs → verified → invoiced → follow-up → paid on time |
| Offer | Back office without hiring a whole team |
